  "review": [
    "Bancod uses the TARIPA sheet per purok. Sheet 2 lists Bancod differently: Purok 1 to 2 ₱30/₱35, Purok 3 and 4 ₱35/₱40, Purok 5/Cambe/Dulo ₱45/₱55. TARIPA has Purok III ₱34, Purok IV ₱36, and Purok V night ₱50.",
    "The CvSU Gate to Bancod route has no night fares in TARIPA; the Indang to Bancod night fares are used. Pickups anywhere in Kaytapos (where CvSU is) count as the CvSU gate.",
    "Guyam Pilipit is not a PSA barangay; it is priced for Guyam Munti.",
    "Calumpang High School Annex is placed in Calumpang Cerca, where Calumpang Integrated National High School is.",
    "The sheet does not say which Mahabang Kahoy places are in Cerca or Lejos, so riders in either barangay choose among all four.",
    "The Buna Cerca junction (pilahan) is placed at the Buna Cerca barangay hall; its table lists Buna Lejos without a fare, which is left out.",
    "Within the Poblacion proper, PCI-PTT Station, Green Valley Subdivision, and Tulay Binambangan count within 200 m of the points found on the map; Ilaya, Lintiw Road, Ramirez and Subdivision sa Palengke are inside Barangay 1 to 4 or could not be placed.",
    "Other Indang trips (neither stop in the Poblacion) use the fare listed for whichever stop is farther from the town plaza (decision 2026-10-02)."
  ]
}